---
import PortfolioLayout from '../../components/v4/PortfolioLayout.astro';
import MosaicArchitecture from '../../components/MosaicArchitecture.astro';
---

<PortfolioLayout title="Research | The Engineer’s Atlas" description="Research experience in retrieval augmented generation and a computer vision thesis.">
  <article class="shell v4-page">
    <p class="v4-kicker">Research experience</p>
    <h1 class="v4-title">Research</h1>
    <div class="research-layout">
      <div class="v4-prose">
        <section>
          <h2>Retrieval and generation</h2>
          <p>From May to July 2026, I interned at the University of Cagliari’s Trustworthy Artificial Intelligence Laboratory, working on retrieval augmented generation and retrieval evaluation. Mosaic-RAG explores the separation of retrieval and answer generation into services.</p>
          <p><a href="/projects/mosaic-rag/">Read the Mosaic-RAG case study →</a></p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2>Aerial computer vision</h2>
          <p>My BSc thesis project is an experimental application for inspecting and storing model detections in aerial media. Its interface keeps detector limitations visible alongside the predicted results.</p>
          <p><a href="/projects/traffic-monitoring/">Read the Traffic Monitoring case study →</a></p>
        </section>
      </div>
      <MosaicArchitecture />
    </div>
  </article>
</PortfolioLayout>

<style>
  .research-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); align-items: start; gap: 1.4rem 4vw; }
  @media (max-width: 780px) { .research-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } }
</style>
